              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū yūbiza yasaagile myaka migehu dūhū ū kūshika a ha ng'waka gwa kūshosha shikolo, būkūbalwa ū wingī wa sabo, hū ūnshokeja ū ngūji wakwe ī sabo yenīyo kūlwa kwikomoolwa kwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
